mage\">Image Tools</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/category/creator\">Creator Tools</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/category/social\">Social Tools</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t Header_linkActive__t3uQf\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"/category/utility\">Utility Tools</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"Header_link__7__6t \" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"Header_actions__SRauh\"><button class=\"Header_themeToggle__nT4h5\" aria-label=\"Switch to dark mode\" title=\"Toggle to dark theme\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z\"></path></svg></button><button class=\"Header_menuToggle__cfdoi\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-nav\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"main-content section\" id=\"main-content\"><div class=\"container\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem;font-size:0.85rem\"><ol style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;align-items:center\"><li><a style=\"color:var(--text-muted);text-decoration:none\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin:0 0.5rem;color:var(--text-muted)\">/</li><li aria-current=\"page\" style=\"color:var(--text-primary);font-weight:600\">Utility Tools</li></ol></nav><div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.5rem;padding:2rem\"><h1 style=\"font-size:2.25rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem\">Utility Tools</h1><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:1.05rem;margin:0;line-height:1.5\">Create QR codes, build UTM links, convert case, count words, and calculate units.</p></div><div class=\"grid-cols-3\" style=\"margin-bottom:3rem\"><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open QR Code Generator - Generate standard QR codes for URLs, text, or Wi-Fi configurations.\" href=\"/tools/utility/qr-code-generator\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.15rem;margin:0\">QR Code Generator</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Generate standard QR codes for URLs, text, or Wi-Fi configurations.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open URL Encoder / Decoder - Encode or decode strings to ensure safe transmission within query parameters.\" href=\"/tools/utility/url-encoder-decoder\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.15rem;margin:0\">URL Encoder / Decoder</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Encode or decode strings to ensure safe transmission within query parameters.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open UTM Campaign Builder - Build marketing campaign links with source, medium, and term tracking codes.\" href=\"/tools/utility/utm-builder\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.15rem;margin:0\">UTM Campaign Builder</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Build marketing campaign links with source, medium, and term tracking codes.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Secure Password Generator - Create cryptographically secure, random passwords with custom rules.\" href=\"/tools/utility/password-generator\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.15rem;margin:0\">Secure Password Generator</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Create cryptographically secure, random passwords with custom rules.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Text Case Converter - Convert text formats: UPPERCASE, lowercase, Title Case, Sentence Case, or slugify.\" href=\"/tools/utility/text-case-converter\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.15rem;margin:0\">Text Case Converter</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Convert text formats: UPPERCASE, lowercase, Title Case, Sentence Case, or slugify.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Word &amp; Sentence Counter - Measure word count, character count, keyword density, and estimated reading time.\" href=\"/tools/utility/word-counter\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.15rem;margin:0\">Word &amp; Sentence Counter</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Measure word count, character count, keyword density, and estimated reading time.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Quick Units Converter - Convert units of length, mass, temperature, area, volume, and data sizes.\" href=\"/tools/utility/units-converter\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.15rem;margin:0\">Quick Units Converter</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Convert units of length, mass, temperature, area, volume, and data sizes.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Time &amp; Timezone Converter - Convert UTC to local time, convert timestamps, and translate world timezones.\" href=\"/tools/utility/time-converter\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.15rem;margin:0\">Time &amp; Timezone Converter</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Convert UTC to local time, convert timestamps, and translate world timezones.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a></div><section class=\"card\" style=\"background-color:var(--bg-primary);padding:2rem;margin-bottom:2rem\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1rem\">About Our <!-- -->Utility Tools<!-- --> Suite</h2><div style=\"font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.6;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem\"><p>Tackle standard daily office and web tasks quickly. Creators Units utility tools provide secure cryptographic password generators, URL encoders, UTM tracking link composers, text case formatters, word counter diagnostics, timezone comparisons, and basic unit calculators.</p><p>All utilities operate inside the client browser. No registration is required. Bookmark this index page to speed up your daily creation, design, and posting workloads.</p></div></section><section aria-labelledby=\"related-cats-heading\" style=\"margin-bottom:2rem\"><h2 id=\"related-cats-heading\" style=\"font-size:1.35rem;margin-bottom:1rem\">You May Also Like</h2><div class=\"grid-cols-4\"><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;padding:1.25rem\" aria-label=\"Image Compressor — Compress PNG, JPG, and WebP images directly in your browser without losing quality.\" href=\"/tools/image/image-compressor\"><span class=\"badge badge-accent\" style=\"font-size:0.6rem;align-self:flex-start\">Image Tools</span><h3 style=\"font-size:1rem;margin:0\">Image Compressor</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Compress PNG, JPG, and WebP images directly in your browser without losing quality.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem\">Open →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;padding:1.25rem\" aria-label=\"Fancy Text Generator — Convert plain text into stylized Unicode fonts for your bios, captions, and posts.\" href=\"/tools/social/fancy-text-generator\"><span class=\"badge badge-accent\" style=\"font-size:0.6rem;align-self:flex-start\">Social Media Tools</span><h3 style=\"font-size:1rem;margin:0\">Fancy Text Generator</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Convert plain text into stylized Unicode fonts for your bios, captions, and posts.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem\">Open →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;padding:1.25rem\" aria-label=\"YouTube Thumbnail Preview — Preview your video thumbnails inside simulated YouTube search, homepage, and sidebar widgets.\" href=\"/tools/creator/youtube-thumbnail-preview\"><span class=\"badge badge-accent\" style=\"font-size:0.6rem;align-self:flex-start\">Creator Tools</span><h3 style=\"font-size:1rem;margin:0\">YouTube Thumbnail Preview</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Preview your video thumbnails inside simulated YouTube search, homepage, and sidebar widgets.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem\">Open →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;padding:1.25rem\" aria-label=\"Bio Template Generator — Generate professional and creative bio outlines for Instagram, TikTok, and Twitter.\" href=\"/tools/social/bio-template-generator\"><span class=\"badge badge-accent\" style=\"font-size:0.6rem;align-self:flex-start\">Social Media Tools</span><h3 style=\"font-size:1rem;margin:0\">Bio Template Generator</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Generate professional and creative bio outlines for Instagram, TikTok, and Twitter.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.25rem\">Open →</span></a></div></section><nav aria-label=\"Browse other categories\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\"><p style=\"font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:0.75rem\">Browse other categories:</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:0.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" href=\"/category/image\">Image Tools</a><a class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" href=\"/category/creator\">Creator Tools</a><a class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" href=\"/category/social\">Social Media Tools</a></div></nav></div></main><footer class=\"Footer_footer__eNA9m\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"Footer_grid__WCfx6\"><div class=\"Footer_brandCol__6UIwg\"><a class=\"Footer_logo__8uCHD\" aria-label=\"Creators Units - Go to homepage\" href=\"/\"><svg class=\"Footer_logoIcon__WWDSF\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=